   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling the time",
     "texto": [
      "**Saat kaç?** = what time is it? For the exact hour, use **Saat üç** (it's three o'clock). To say «at three o'clock», add **-te/-ta**: **Saat üçte**.",
      "**Saat yedide** = at seven; **Saat dokuzda** = at nine. The locative suffix changes according to the last vowel and consonant.",
      "**Önce** means «before» and **sonra** means «after»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Days of the week",
     "texto": [
      "Days are not written with a capital letter, unlike in English: **pazartesi, salı, çarşamba, perşembe, cuma, cumartesi, pazar**.",
      "**Pazartesi günü** = on Monday (literally, the day Monday). **Hafta sonu** means «weekend»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
